Subtask Workflow (6-state lifecycle):
  ⬜ empty → 🔄 in_progress → 🟡 review → ✅ completed
                                      ↘ 🔴 blocked
                                      ↘ ⏭️ skipped

  Agent workflow:
    1. clawboard start-subtask TASK_ID INDEX     (marks in_progress)
    2. Work on subtask...
    3. clawboard complete-subtask TASK_ID INDEX  (marks review)
    4. When all done: clawboard move TASK_ID stuck --notes "Ready for review"

  Orchestrator workflow:
    1. clawboard review TASK_ID                  (see all subtasks)
    2. For each subtask in review:
       clawboard approve-subtask TASK_ID INDEX   (marks completed)
       clawboard reject-subtask TASK_ID INDEX    (back to empty)
       clawboard block-subtask TASK_ID INDEX     (marks blocked)
       clawboard skip-subtask TASK_ID INDEX      (marks skipped, counts as done)
    3. clawboard move TASK_ID completed          (requires all subtasks done)
"""
